:"十五下","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"豐足宣帝從任在外后常留家有相者謂后曰"},{"pdf_page":18,"half":"右","leaf":"十五下","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"夫人有貴子而不見之后歎曰我三子誰當應"},{"pdf_page":18,"half":"右","leaf":"十五下","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":12,"text":"之呼高帝小字曰政應是汝耳"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-chendaozhi-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001","text":"齊宣孝陳皇后諱道止，臨淮東陽人，魏司徒矯之後也。后家貧，少勤織作，家人矜其勞，或止之，后終不改。嫁于宣帝。宣帝庶生子衡陽元王道度、始安貞王道生，后生高帝。高帝年二歲，乳人乏乳，后夢人以兩甌麻粥與之，覺而乳驚，因此豐足。宣帝從任在外，后常留家，有相者謂后曰：「夫人有貴子而不見之。」后歎曰：「我三子，誰當應之？」呼高帝小字曰：「政應是汝耳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0001","start":1,"end":6,"surface":"宣孝陳皇后","person_id":"pib_5me_1wm_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本傳及互見本紀、宗室傳的所指。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"道止","person_id":"pib_5me_1wm_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本傳及互見本紀、宗室傳的所指。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"矯","person_id":"y5v_7tv_nxw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本傳及互見本紀、宗室傳的所指。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:u0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"家人","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本傳未出姓名。家人、乳人與相者各依原稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"宣帝","person_id":"egx_xax_4ic","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本傳及互見本紀、宗室傳的所指。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"道度","person_id":"egx_xax_4ic_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本傳及互見本紀、宗室傳的所指。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chendaozhi:p001:m0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"道生","person_id":"98q_mll_d6v","kind":"pe